c_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTMdj-0VbbTaDZXR0A4OGV8rgDC4qJSp_Vn4UvMBXlEAQ&oe=6B05AD83"}, {"file_name": "3.png", "id": "1057237765993092", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031554_1057237769326425_2363224287171852583_n.png?_nc_cat=106&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1MiNeMKh0ZUQ7kNvwGG7y2n&_nc_oc=Adoih24Je3kCA99bsoxVLPJW86ZXuQ9qDt_8fMKLa4ZNSxou5CR5TN9_nn5sYFxbdEA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSZStVvt-pJAIouIVVp5Xa7VKlrwguo8VPK8Hh0vJIHwA&oe=6B05BAA6"}, {"file_name": "4.png", "id": "1488377815132033", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001670_1488377818465366_4369730771137685134_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=nf_DrPWz9Y4Q7kNvwHVIeK_&_nc_oc=AdqqlKchJyrPH1WZYdEm1u1a16j_UHQoOH-sTZKLts_xRnSgt6YabvnLnHXhMfR2vyA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRGtX4p0nGjfY5Y0V1qOoj79tNtzUr8xHZp91uTEG0_Rg&oe=6B05B704"}, {"file_name": "5.png", "id": "414882827722865", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982480_414882831056198_2207792374391745331_n.png?_nc_cat=105&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=IFHCDF8by0YQ7kNvwFL5LQz&_nc_oc=Adr8qwSy8vBOThctaebbHkTiPcNLR4z8opd4E9JCqS2kRtBt_3frRrZa50qaYNiVc4E&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQV2ZvfPXVSgeApO0bM0ysQAHOUb2XAvRUvUy7m5P2JHQ&oe=6B05AA3D"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "16x9-2.png", "id": "811607170639171", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/86609236_811607173972504_8101196321901847264_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=4vcax8KJCiEQ7kNvwHVF9w7&_nc_oc=AdqNpoXSIpFRHsbsncD21ctwKmkEbdGajwmn8eLYxYXYZOV7TGBGn_pJVEuOsihg_Ds&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQR5g9RM2kpCsOyMt0QtaB9rh5mW-Mvl0cf3lsYuP7LF0w&oe=6B05D741"}, "display_name": "Void Ninja Demo", "keywords": ["action", "platformer", "ninja", "void", "runner"], "long_description": "Void Ninja is an **action platformer** game that blends runner elements with a unique **\u201cJinba Ittai\u201d locomotion**.  \n\n\ud83d\udc49Gameplay: You're **always on the move and can't stop**. Use your hips and shoulders to steer on the path. Overcome obstacles and clear out enemies.   \n\n\ud83d\udc49**Just one button \u2014 let your body do the rest!*** \nYou don't need to remember million of combinations, or press something to move  - run with the flow.  \n\n\ud83e\udd77\ud83e\udd77\ud83e\udd77  \n\n# Key Features:\n\n- **Unique natural flow locomotion:**   \nInspired by the \"Jinba Ittai\" philosophy, this system ensures perfect unity between player and the game - you simply act as you would in real life  \n\u2796  \n- **Comfort / Motion sickness tested:**  \n 85% of players experienced no symptoms, 10% adapted after 30 minutes, and 5% did not adjust and we prefer not to talk about them  \n\u2796 \n- **Platformer / runner:**   \nFirst-person platforming adventure inspired by a certain blue hedgehog. Intense combats,  adrenaline-pumping jumps and jet-powered flights - this game will keep your heart racing   \n \u2796 \n- **Combat dance:**   \nAs you progress, you'll develop your own unique moves and combos crafted by your skill, not pre-made by the developers  \n \u2796\n- **Level reassembly:**   \nEach time you load a level, it\u2019s generated in a new and unique way   \n\n\n\n\ud83e\udea7**4 demo levels**   \n\u279517 extra levesl available in the paid supporter version\n\n\ud83e\udd77\ud83e\udd77\ud83e\udd77 \n\nThis is work in progress version.\n**Share your thoughts, ideas and feedback with us** - let's make the game together.\n\n*rarely its 2 buttons, but you won't confuse them. Only 1 sounds better, right?\n", "short_description": "Action platformer with gesture based controls and unique locomotion."}]}, "developer_name": "Roman 